  "dek": "ARCward Intelligence returns to the provisional gold band at an unchanged score. Varstern 6037 reaches fortieth with a second score increase.",
  "discord": "ARC-AGI-2 Late edition: a field of 3,001 teams brings sixteen provisional gold places, restoring unchanged ARCward Intelligence at 57.08 to the band. Varstern 6037 closes 40th after a second score step. Tufa Labs, Yi-Chia Chen and rabbithole retain the podium. https://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-17-evening-arc-2",
  "edition": "evening",
